  "scope": "All six active flavors and the full symmetric block are retained. The initial spin-coherent state is identical across repairs. Both the clock Hamiltonian and its coordinate/momentum readout change. First- and second-order repairs have fixed collective polynomial degree; exact inverse-square-root compensation and its top-sector projector generally require growing microscopic interaction order. The remaining exact-compensation error is finite-boundary error. This is not a tensor-lattice clock factorization or Einstein limit.",
